  "limitations": [
    "Body topology is authored as parameterized surface rings and junction patches, triangulated on export; final artistic editing remains open.",
    "Fingers are static geometry driven by the forearm bones, without finger joints or grasp animations. Feet are simplified volumes without separate toes.",
    "Head ears and facial overlays are separate connected components; neck is a controlled overlapping attachment.",
    "Body UVs use explicit regional charts; final packing, gutters, overlap checks and uniform texel density remain pending.",
    "Four procedural maps are painted-plane studies; the generated transparent head guide is an artistic reference, not a runtime texture.",
    "No hair, beards, equipment, animation clips, facial rig, saved appearance, game renderer integration or measured physical-device FPS."
  ]
